#: ABQflow.core.backends.base.ExecutionBackend.probe_cores:1 of
msgid "Physical core count of the executing machine, or ``None`` if unknown."
msgstr ""

#: ABQflow.core.backends.base.ExecutionBackend.probe_cores:3 of
msgid ""
"Only ever advisory: it fills in an unset ``HostSpec.cpus_total`` so a "
"pooled batch can size concurrency and report oversubscription for a "
"remote machine the same way it already does for the local one.  A backend"
" that cannot answer returns ``None`` rather than guessing — the caller "
"then asks the user for ``cpus_total``."
msgstr ""

#: ABQflow.core.backends.base.ExecutionBackend.read_text:1
